# Phase 3 Plan 09: dev rehearsal run log

Dataset: blog_posts_dev (D-10). Every command below was run with `--env-file .env.local`.
Neither `.env` nor `.env.vercel-prod` was used for any writing command in this plan; the
production run is plan 03-10 and it sits behind a human gate. The one production command in
this log is the read-only `--post-run` guard at the end, which proves the production Farsi
count is still zero.

Secret discipline: every capture below is this repository's own stdout and stderr. No
environment value was pasted in, and no key prefix or Postgres connection-URL scheme appears
anywhere in this file. Asserted mechanically at the end of the plan.

Transport: the Claude Code CLI on Saeid's subscription (D-16). Marginal cost of everything in
this log is $0. The token counts recorded here are CLI-reported measurements, not prices.


